1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,405
Conventional career advice offers two bad choices:

2
00:00:03,405 --> 00:00:05,584
play it completely safe forever,

3
00:00:05,584 --> 00:00:07,287
or burn your boats on one

4
00:00:07,287 --> 00:00:08,240
reckless leap.

5
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:10,559
Risk scholar Nassim Taleb outlined a

6
00:00:10,559 --> 00:00:13,265
smarter third system in Antifragile called

7
00:00:13,265 --> 00:00:14,618
the Barbell Strategy.

8
00:00:14,618 --> 00:00:17,259
Skip fragile moderate risk in the middle,

9
00:00:17,259 --> 00:00:19,900
and deliberately weight the two extremes.

10
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:22,453
Put ninety percent of your foundation

11
00:00:22,453 --> 00:00:23,832
on ironclad defense:

12
00:00:23,832 --> 00:00:25,419
steady career cashflow,

13
00:00:25,419 --> 00:00:26,730
low fixed overhead,

14
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:28,110
and liquid reserves.

15
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:29,214
Put ten percent,

16
00:00:29,214 --> 00:00:31,007
five focused hours a week,

17
00:00:31,007 --> 00:00:32,870
into uncapped digital bets.

18
00:00:32,870 --> 00:00:34,406
Use the Barbell Rule:

19
00:00:34,406 --> 00:00:36,748
never risk stability you need to

20
00:00:36,748 --> 00:00:38,357
sleep calmly at night,

21
00:00:38,357 --> 00:00:40,186
and never let a week pass

22
00:00:40,186 --> 00:00:43,039
without shipping one small project with

23
00:00:43,039 --> 00:00:44,210
uncapped upside.

24
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:46,172
When your downside is protected,

25
00:00:46,172 --> 00:00:49,360
patience turns asymmetric bets into inevitable wins.
